# The Remote Pilot: a plugin that does something beside the user's code rather than shaping it.
#
# Declared separately from com.botmaker.plugin.api.StudioPlugin because they are unrelated interfaces, not
# because they ship separately — both are in this jar and both are found on the same discovery pass.
#
# Naming an interface whose dependency is <optional> is safe: ServiceLoader resolves this file only when
# something asks for com.botmaker.plugin.api.CompanionPlugin, and nothing on a bot's classpath ever does.
com.botmaker.sdk.plugin.PilotCompanion
